# autotest alpha.10 batch G (lane SC2, 2026-11-24). Written against the Feature text with sha 5e611eff4b5a559d; honest subset only: what a screen or the guest shows is under clause, everything else under not-covered.
row: F-SHELL-62
targets: qemu
profile: ram
feature-sha: 5e611eff4b5a559d
doc: Settings, Account lists the built-in themes Dark, Light and High contrast (read only)
clause: 1 Settings, Account lists the built-in themes Dark, Light and High contrast beside which a person's own theme file would appear
not-covered: a theme file a person adds and its appearing in the list
not-covered: a damaged theme file being refused
key s
wait app=Settings
skip-unless-button Account
click-sidebar Account
wait app=Settings page="Account"
shot page
expect-not-blank
expect-text Dark
expect-text Light
expect-text High contrast
expect-page Account
